        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I’m so happy with the service I received from Robert Proulx. I had called a couple of other plumbers that were recommended in a fb group and none of them were able to give me direct answers. After speaking with Robert Proulx, first of all, he knew the right questions to ask and even asked for pics, he was confident it was an easy job that could be done within an hour and was transparent with the pricing. It was obvious he's very experienced. He squeezed us in the next day between 2 jobs and it was done very quickly and professionally.\nDefinitely will be recommending him and using him again the future!",
        "time": 1712707162,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Simone K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113730381535146723502/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLi-PM0o64tgwzg0YhLiLXE2BPep7JKgXaBiTsgB7CcKwMGBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Best plumbing service!! Mr Proulx is very knowledgeable, takes the time to verify, identify and explain very well what the issue is. Repair was done quickly and efficiently. Extremely satisfied with his customer service, advice and referral to another professional for appliance repair. I highly recommend!",
        "time": 1681944872,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cheryl Jenkins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100650674016315402269/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJi28M2BhysZ2fnsvSO6pxAmCj42L6O19Lcq3h8w4P0jERK5g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Robert was very meticulous, professional and respectful of my home. During the course of his repairs, he encountered a few problems. Each time he tried to find a cost effective solution without compromising quality. He had to break two ceramic tiles to fix a leak in the plumbing in the bathtub. I am a widow and senior citizen and had no idea how I was going to replace them. Even though it is not the job of a plumber, he replaced them for me. He did such a good job, you can’t even tell which ones he replaced.\nI highly recommend Plomberie Robert Proulx for all your plumbing needs. His prices are competitive and he will resolve your plumbing issues; leaving your home as clean as before he started the job. You will have peace of mind knowing that the work done will more than meet your expectations.",
        "time": 1671569769,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
